    "text": "WALB 10\nwebsite\nLeesburg\nLost puppy found two days after wandering from crash\nBy WALB News Team,\n6 hours agoLEESBURG, Ga. (WALB) - A South Georgia family is expressing their gratitude to the people of Leesburg who helped search for the puppy, named Monkey, for the past two days. According to one of the owners, Jack Pitts and Donna Griffin, Monkey was found miles from the crash site near Always Caring Home Care in Leesburg.\n3",
